## SECTION 5: PERFORMANCE TARGETS AND WHAT TO EXPECT

### Realistic Performance Numbers You Can Cite to Judges

| Metric | Target | Realistic Range | Research Basis |
|--------|--------|-----------------|----------------|
| Human detection mAP | 80%+ | 73-85% (daytime) | YOLOv8 COCO benchmark |
| Human detection (night) | 60%+ | 55-65% (after CLAHE) | ExDark dataset results |
| ANPR accuracy (daylight) | 93%+ | 90-97% (clean plates) | Indian ANPR studies |
| ANPR accuracy (night) | 75%+ | 65-80% (with IR) | CCPD-Night benchmark |
| FRS (outdoor, daytime) | 90%+ | 88-95% (>1m, good light) | InsightFace ArcFace |
| FRS (outdoor, night) | 75%+ | 70-80% (enhanced frame) | Degraded condition studies |
| Intrusion detection recall | 95%+ | 92-97% (clear view) | Polygon tracking logic |
| Suspicious activity (loitering) | 85%+ | 80-90% (zone-based) | Rule-based systems |
| Suspicious activity (pose) | 75%+ | 70-82% (visible body) | MediaPipe benchmarks |
| False positive rate target | <15% | 15-25% (real-world) | Industry standard |
| Alert latency | <2 seconds | 0.5-3 seconds | Depends on GPU |
| Supported concurrent cameras | 8-16 | 8 (RTX 3070), 16 (A100) | YOLOv8 throughput tests |

