## SECTION 7: RECOMMENDED TECH STACK (FINAL)

```
Layer           | Technology              | Why
----------------|-------------------------|----------------------------------
Object Detection| YOLOv8n (ultralytics)   | Fastest, COCO-pretrained, Python API
Tracking        | ByteTrack               | Best MOT benchmark scores
Face Detection  | RetinaFace (insightface)| Best accuracy for small/angled faces
Face Embeddings | ArcFace (buffalo_l)     | 99.83% LFW, 512-dim embeddings
Face DB Search  | FAISS (Facebook)        | Million-scale vector search, <10ms
ANPR Detection  | YOLOv8s (LP dataset)   | Pretrained on license plate datasets
ANPR OCR        | EasyOCR + regex post   | Indian font support, open source
Pose Estimation | MediaPipe BlazePose     | Fastest, mobile-optimized
Night Enhance   | CLAHE + Gamma (OpenCV) | No extra model, zero latency
Frame Streaming | OpenCV + threading      | Proven, well-documented
Backend API     | FastAPI                 | Async, WebSocket, OpenAPI docs
Real-time Push  | Redis Pub/Sub + WSS     | <5ms latency, scalable
Database        | PostgreSQL              | ACID, structured alerts + logs
Frontend        | React + Tailwind        | Fast to build dashboard
Video save      | OpenCV VideoWriter      | Clip buffer for alerts
Packaging       | Docker + docker-compose | Easy deployment, reproducible
GPU Inference   | CUDA (NVIDIA) or CPU    | YOLOv8 supports both
```

